{"id":"vod_md_4818","vodId":"4818","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"约定的梦幻岛","name_cn":"约定的梦幻岛","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230913-1/07a08bd5e9a93b793247160db111125a.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为恩典农场的孤儿院内，在这里生活着很多失去了亲人，无家可归的孩子们，他们共有36人，每天，在劳作和玩耍之余，孩子们还要进行学习和测验，其中，佼佼者是名为艾玛（诸星堇 配音）的女孩和名为诺曼（内田真礼 配音）的男孩。负责管理和看护这些孩子们的女性名叫伊莎贝拉（甲斐田裕子 配音），孩子们喜欢喊她“妈妈”。每过一段时间，都会有一个孩子被收养离开农场，生活在这里的孩子们都将此作为自己的人生目标。一次偶然中，艾玛发现了隐藏在这座孤儿院背后的秘密，那些离开的孩子根本就没有被领养，而是被屠宰了，生活在恩典农场的孩子们，其实就是这座农场所饲养的“牲畜”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-13 08:15:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230911/6WjpOPgo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230911/vKo976WL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230911/HyJxNzji/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230911/YlpZ93JT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230911/TKnI9h1r/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230911/0GMV1c9E/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230911/JuWP8i2s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230911/UYY0KyST/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230911/6ZMbpBJW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230911/srQ5vKve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230911/Cd4qNWOA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230911/EUyj8N55/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:05.761Z"}